no-eorg-popup-label = Join our team!
no-eorg-popup-message =
    Become the shield of our server and get an [bold][color=#e5c158]exclusive donor role[/color][/bold] along with [bold][color=#e5c158]special bonuses[/color][/bold] right after your internship (subject to active participation)!
    
    We are looking for driven and active players (even beginners) who are ready to:
    • Pacify chaos
    • Create something new
    • Help players as part of our friendly team
    
    Leave an application in Discord via a ticket in the [bold]"become a volunteer"[/bold] category and start your journey in the project team right now!
no-eorg-popup-rule = [bold][color=#a4885c]Recruitment for the volunteer team![/color][/bold]
no-eorg-popup-close-button = Got it!
no-eorg-popup-volunteer-button = Become a volunteer
no-eorg-popup-close-button-wait = The close button will be enabled after {$time} seconds.
no-eorg-popup-skip-checkbox = Don't show this again.

cmd-lobbypopuptoggle-desc = Enable or disable the volunteer recruitment popup in the lobby.
cmd-lobbypopuptoggle-help = Usage: lobbypopuptoggle <true/false>

cmd-lobbypopupsetmessage-desc = Change the message text in the volunteer recruitment window.
cmd-lobbypopupsetmessage-help = Usage: lobbypopupsetmessage <message text>

cmd-lobbypopupsetlink-desc = Change the link in the volunteer recruitment window.
cmd-lobbypopupsetlink-help = Usage: lobbypopupsetlink <link>
